  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whispers follow Kranky's wake in the underbelly of Subchain City, tales of a duck driven by loss. The Blood Stained Shirt is a constant reminder of the flock he failed, a burden he carries as he seeks vengeance and DRIP.",
